[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6250.31, "timestamp": "01:44:10", "text": "え？ そうそう。 弾丸はまだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6252.87, "timestamp": "01:44:12", "text": "銃の中に残っていた。 あの5秒間を覚えていますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6254.47, "timestamp": "01:44:14", "text": "彼らは未来にいるんだね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6256.47, "timestamp": "01:44:16", "text": "ああ、なるほど。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6259.189, "timestamp": "01:44:19", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6263.51, "timestamp": "01:44:23", "text": "ほら、ジョーがまた自慢してるよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6265.75, "timestamp": "01:44:25", "text": "彼は世界的な人物だよ、兄弟。 ピンク色は彼を定義するものではないよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6267.59, "timestamp": "01:44:27", "text": "、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6269.91, "timestamp": "01:44:29", "text": "いや、違うよ。 彼は世界的に有名だよ、兄弟。 彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6272.149, "timestamp": "01:44:32", "text": "本当にRQにいるんだよ、兄弟。 紙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6273.189, "timestamp": "01:44:33", "text": "X。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6275.189, "timestamp": "01:44:35", "text": "ああ、わかってるよ。   もちろんさ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6276.07, "timestamp": "01:44:36", "text": "、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6278.07, "timestamp": "01:44:38", "text": "なぜあなたはOhを持っているのですか。 ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6279.03, "timestamp": "01:44:39", "text": "シンガポールに戻ったんですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6280.79, "timestamp": "01:44:40", "text": "うん。 うん。 シンガポールに戻るべきでしょうか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.35, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "？ 将来も行きたいですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6286.709, "timestamp": "01:44:46", "text": "？ いいえ。過去へ行きなさい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6288.47, "timestamp": "01:44:48", "text": "未来もどこへ行っても大丈夫だと私に言ってくれた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6290.709, "timestamp": "01:44:50", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6292.07, "timestamp": "01:44:52", "text": "しかし、それは何の違いも生まない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6293.669, "timestamp": "01:44:53", "text": "うん、未来はかなり暗いね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6297.27, "timestamp": "01:44:57", "text": "俺のスマホは水に浸かってるんだよ"}]